tldcab         DFALT_LIST      YA TIDAK

EDITS(tmptranst)
e.Mandatory             tlddvs          MANDATORY_IF chm2
e.Mandatory             tldcab          MANDATORY_IF chm1


HOOKS(tmptranst)
BEFORE_INPUT    cur_field=tldcab        DO_SKIP_IF chm2
